# Level 17, Spiral: The machine act begins: the Wall turned into a rising sequence, an arpeggio that spirals up the octave.
# E aeolian, 128 BPM; Act 3; A wall_seq, B spark_seq, counter ascent_head.
# compose.py's parts, orchestrated for Act 3 by audio/compose_studio.py:
# do not edit.
score 1
title BRYX 17 Spiral
# mode E aeolian
tempo 0 128
length 64
loop on
seed 1
include ../instruments/desk.inc
include ../instruments/orchestra.inc
include ../instruments/electronic.inc
